@startuml
title Cyber AI - Chat Collaboration Diagram

actor "User" as User
rectangle "ChatWorkspace" as UI
rectangle "AI API" as AI
rectangle "Brave Search" as Brave

User -> UI : 1: type message
UI -> AI : 2: POST /chat

AI --> UI : 3: stream reply (SSE)
UI --> User : 4: show reply

UI -> Brave : 5: search query (fallback)
Brave --> UI : 6: search results
UI --> User : 7: show fallback reply

note right of Brave
  Steps 5-7 execute only
  when the AI API fails.
end note
@enduml